  "title": "The $98B warning: Power-ready isn’t shovel-ready",
  "summary": "Part 2 of the Development De-risking series. In Part 1, we covered how data center developers can validate power at every stage of the power funnel. But $98 billion in blocked and delayed data center projects in Q2 2025 alone signals that power readiness isn't enough; the real opportunity to get ahead lies in parallel power and risk diligence. The teams winning the development race are validating power and other risks simultaneously, and doing so quickly.",
